{
  "tema": 6055,
  "slug": "esto-este-esta-pronombre",
  "titulo": "Esto, este, esta, estos, estas: this one, these",
  "subtitulo": "¿Cuál quieres? Este.",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "For this one / these (ones), use este, esta, estos, estas, matching the noun you mean, with no noun after it. For an unknown thing or an idea, use esto, which never changes: ¿Qué es esto?",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "A demonstrative **pronoun** replaces the noun: _this one_, _these ones_. Spanish doesn't need _one_: **este** = _this one_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "Masculine",
            "Feminine",
            "Neutral"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "Singular",
              "**este**",
              "**esta**",
              "**esto**"
            ],
            [
              "Plural",
              "**estos**",
              "**estas**",
              "—"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Match the gender and number of the thing you mean: la camisa → **esta**; los tenis → **estos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Esto** is neutral: use it for something you can't name yet, or for an idea or situation: ¿Qué es **esto**? **Esto** es muy fácil. It has no plural."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Today these pronouns are written **without an accent**: **este**, not _éste_. You may still see the accent in older texts."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **esto** ends in -o but isn't masculine. It's the mystery box: _this thing_."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿Qué tabla te gusta? —==Esta==, la azul.",
              "en": "Which board do you like? —This one, the blue one."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Este== es mi hermano, Raúl.",
              "en": "This is my brother, Raúl."
            },
            {
              "es": "No quiero esos tacos; quiero ==estos==.",
              "en": "I don't want those tacos; I want these."
            },
            {
              "es": "De todas las playas de Baja, ==esta== es mi favorita.",
              "en": "Of all the beaches in Baja, this one is my favorite."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Qué es ==esto==? Huele rarísimo.",
              "en": "What is this? It smells really weird."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Esto== no es justo.",
              "en": "This isn't fair."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis plantas favoritas son ==estas==: las de chile.",
              "en": "My favorite plants are these: the chili ones."
            },
            {
              "es": "Hoy practicamos dos llaves: ==esta== y la de ayer.",
              "en": "Today we practiced two submissions: this one and yesterday's."
